<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-E.P. 118-6 AT LUNCH AGAINST BOLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-E.P. 118-6 AT LUNCH AGAINST BOLAND.</headline>
<dateline>PAARL 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Province reached 118 for six wickets at lunch on the second day of their Supersport Series match against Boland in Paarl on Monday.</p>
<p>Boland first innings 204 (Kenny Jackson 120)</p>
<p>Eastern Province 118-6 (James Albanie 4-17)</p>
